INSERT INTO SACH
VALUES ('PD01',
		'Perennial Death',
		'"Before the world ended, movies often portrayed zombies as hunters. Slavering beasts who slowly chased down their prey. This never made much sense to me. Why would something as fragile and sluggish as a zombie try to chase someone? Zombies are predators. But they are not the kind you are thinking of. They are not wolves, or lions, or bears. If anything, a zombie is a very deadly carnivorous plant. Like a Venus Fly Trap, it lies in wait for some poor, unsuspecting soul to come too close. And then it strikes."' + CHAR(13) + CHAR(10) + CHAR(13) + CHAR(10) + 'Zac is a boy living during the zombie apocalypse. Except, he does not feel very alive. Most of the time, he relates more to the undead who are hunting him than the humans by his side. Time and time again he makes friends, finds family...and loses them all. Follow him in a tale of terror and tragedy as he tries to find peace at the end of the world.',
		'Rosaura Irene',
		'Rosaura Irene',
		'20220212',
		'Digital',
		NULL,
		'AVAILABLE',
		'~/Images/Books/PerennialDeath.jpeg')

